{"title": "Off-Hand Attack (Melee)", "pageid": 26587, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Off-Hand_Attack_(Melee)", "categories": ["Weapon actions", "Bonus actions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Off-Hand_Attack_Melee.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Off-Hand_Attack_Melee.webp/300px-Off-Hand_Attack_Melee.webp, /w/images/1/1b/Off-Hand_Attack_Melee.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Off-Hand_Attack_Melee.webp/300px-Off-Hand_Attack_Melee.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Off-Hand_Attack_Melee.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Off-Hand Attack (Melee)</b> is a weapon action that allows the user to make a melee attack with the weapon equipped in their off hand.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nMake a melee attack with your off-hand weapon.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd><dt>Damage</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Normal weapon damage</div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Attack\" title=\"Main Hand Attack\">Main Hand Attack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Off-Hand_Attack_(Ranged)\" title=\"Off-Hand Attack (Ranged)\">Off-Hand Attack (Ranged)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ranged_Attack\" title=\"Ranged Attack\">Ranged Attack</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Only the weapon die and proficiency bonus<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"double check that the pro...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup> are applied to off-hand attacks. The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Two-Weapon_Fighting\" title=\"Two-Weapon Fighting\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/25px-Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/38px-Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/50px-Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Two-Weapon Fighting\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/25px-Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Two-Weapon_Fighting\" title=\"Two-Weapon Fighting\">Two-Weapon Fighting</a> fighting style is required to add the <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_score_modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability score modifier\">ability score modifier</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Male <a href=\"/wiki/Dwarf\" title=\"Dwarf\">Dwarves</a> have an erroneous animation map key bound to off-hand melee attacks initiated from outside melee range, i.e. 1.5 m (5 ft), resulting in a double attack when a specific combination of weapons is equipped:\n<ul><li>The main-hand weapon must be <code>Small1H</code><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=Small1H+type:equipmenttype\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=Small1H+type:equipmenttype\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> (e.g. a <a href=\"/wiki/Daggers\" title=\"Daggers\">Dagger</a>)</li>\n<li>The off-hand weapon must be <code>Piercing1H</code><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=Piercing1H+type:equipmenttype\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=Piercing1H+type:equipmenttype\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> (e.g. a <a href=\"/wiki/Shortswords\" title=\"Shortswords\">Shortsword</a>)</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035335\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1848/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21591/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11673/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1024953/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.965      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   43.965      1 -